  "changed_since_previous": "Diff is now available; the implementation adds explicit errors for `coins_per_txid == 0` during deserialization and for `maybe_stats->coins_count != coins_count` after the content hash check in `ChainstateManager::PopulateAndValidateSnapshot`.",
  "card": "Validates snapshot metadata coin counts against unique coins imported and disallows empty transaction groups during assumeutxo snapshot loading. Previously, snapshots with duplicated records could pass UTXO set hash verification while reporting an inflated coin count, and empty groups could bypass loop interrupt checks to delay node shutdown. Legitimate snapshots generated by dumptxoutset already only produce non-empty groups, preserving compatibility.",
